{"id":20,"date":"2025-07-13T11:56:47","date_gmt":"2025-07-13T06:26:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/?page_id=20"},"modified":"2026-08-02T15:05:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-02T09:35:37","slug":"products","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/products\/","title":{"rendered":"Products"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Product solutions from Titan Flow Valves include a comprehensive range of industrial valves engineered to meet the rigorous demands of oil &amp; gas, power generation, water treatment, petrochemical, steel, and general engineering industries. Each valve product is designed for high performance, corrosion resistance, tight shutoff, and dependable long-term service life, ensuring safe and efficient operation across critical applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">OVERVIEW<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Titan Flow Valves is a fast-growing <strong>industrial valve company<\/strong> based in Thane, Maharashtra, serving as a trusted <strong>valve manufacturer, supplier, dealer, distributor, exporter, stockist, and trader<\/strong> across India. In our first year alone, we&#8217;ve successfully completed <strong>50+ projects<\/strong>, helping industries <strong>buy industrial valves<\/strong> with reliable performance and long-lasting service life. Our product portfolio includes a wide range of valves such as <strong>gate valves, globe valves, ball valves, butterfly valves, check valves, non-return valves (NRV), control valves, plug valves, piston valves, pressure reducing valves, strainer valves, diaphragm valves, needle valves, knife gate valves, pinch valves, pressure seal valves, safety valves, relief valves, steam trap valves, and solenoid valves<\/strong> \u2014 built to suit diverse industrial applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We manufacture and supply valves in multiple materials, including <strong>cast iron valves, forged steel valves, stainless steel valves, carbon steel valves, alloy steel valves, bronze valves, brass valves, duplex steel valves, Inconel valves, and Monel valves<\/strong>, chosen to match each customer&#8217;s specific process requirements. Our valves are trusted across critical sectors like <strong>oil and gas valves, petrochemical valves, refinery valves, fertilizer plant valves, pharma industry valves, chemical industry valves, power plant valves, steam valves, water valves, and firefighting valves<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For specialized operations, we offer <strong>high pressure valves, low pressure valves, pressure control valves, PN16 valves, PN40 valves, Class 150 valves, Class 300 valves, Class 600 valves<\/strong>, in both <strong>large size and small size valves<\/strong>, ensuring compatibility with every pipeline and process condition. Our range also covers both manual and automated options \u2014 <strong>manual valves, motorized valves, pneumatic valves, hydraulic valves, electric actuator valves, automated valves, remote operated valves, smart valves, control automation valves, and on-off valves<\/strong> \u2014 giving customers flexibility based on their operational needs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We&#8217;re committed to quality and compliance, delivering both <strong>IBR approved valves and Non-IBR valves<\/strong> for steam and thermal applications. As one of the emerging <strong>industrial valve exporters in India<\/strong>, we supply <strong>high performance valves for oil &amp; gas<\/strong>, work closely with <strong>valve dealers for chemical plants<\/strong>, and serve as a reliable <strong>steam management valves supplier<\/strong>. Whether you want to <strong>buy ball valves online in India<\/strong> or are searching for <strong>top valve distributors near me<\/strong>, our team ensures quick response and dependable supply.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a <strong>customized industrial valves<\/strong> provider, we specialize in <strong>heavy duty valves for refineries<\/strong> and operate as a growing <strong>industrial valve stockist in Mumbai<\/strong> \u2014 building our reputation among the <strong>leading valve suppliers in India<\/strong>, one project at a time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Types of Valves We Offer:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Products:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1536\" data-attachment-id=\"317\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/products\/forged-steel-gate-valve-2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/forged-steel-gate-valve-1.png?fit=1024%2C1536&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1536\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"FORGED STEEL GATE VALVE\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/forged-steel-gate-valve-1.png?fit=683%2C1024&amp;ss